            "review_text": "Wombattom\nMurrumbeena, Australia50 contributions\n0\nTraditional duck dishes\nDec 2023 • Friends\nDropped in as we were walking past after exploring local market nearby. Owner friendly and relatively good English. Had an English menu which made it easier. We shred the porridge with added duck slices and duck salad. Was sport in, fresh and healthy. Beers were cold and value for money. Think around 150.000 for the two of us and we couldn’t eat it all.\nRead more\nWritten January 12, 2024",
